# SKID KIDS: left alone on the title, the cartridge plays a CPU-against-CPU
# demo that never ends (the score keeps climbing past 15); any button goes
# back to the title. A secret: left long enough to reach 999 each, the Coach
# calls it a day.
seed 25
game skidkids
wait 20
expect state == 0
wait 720
expect state == 15
expect mstate <= 1
cheat score 30 28
wait 600
expect mstate == 1
expect nines == 0
press A
expect state == 0
cheat demo
cheat score 998 998
waituntil nines == 1 6000
expect score0 == 999
expect score1 == 999
